{"Title":"An Act relative to the open meeting law","BillNumber":"H3121","DocketNumber":"HD2204","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"E_U1","Name":"Erika Uyterhoeven","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_U1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:22:33.383"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"E_U1","Name":"Erika Uyterhoeven","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_U1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:22:33.3833333"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-10T19:56:17.2433333"},{"Id":"M_C1","Name":"Mike Connolly","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/M_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-27T11:09:15.7366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3121/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Uyterhoeven of Somerville, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3121) of Erika Uyterhoeven for legislation to make the General Court subject to the open meeting law.  State Administration and Regulatory Oversight.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 18 of chapter 30A of the General Laws, is hereby amended in the definition of \"Public Body\", by striking the phrase \"the general court or the committees or recess commissions thereof\".\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}